{"id":"1e283d3b9b045d56","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-modified-realizability-witness.md","title":"改良实现者的数值见证与函数见证","display":"thm-modified-realizability-witness — 改良实现者的数值见证与函数见证","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-modified-realizability-witness","aliases":["72-thm-modified-realizability-witness"],"display":"thm-modified-realizability-witness — 改良实现者的数值见证与函数见证","depends_on":["[[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI Definition3.4, print431/PDF443; local typed extraction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-modified-realizability-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-modified-realizability-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-modified-realizability-witness — 改良实现者的数值见证与函数见证"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5341a0bc9ba0e23a\" href=\"?note=5341a0bc9ba0e23a\" title=\"72-df-modified-realizability-full-model\">72-df-modified-realizability-full-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI Definition3.4, print431/PDF443; local typed extraction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5341a0bc9ba0e23a\" href=\"?note=5341a0bc9ba0e23a\" title=\"72-df-modified-realizability-full-model\">72-df-modified-realizability-full-model</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal M_a\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal M_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\omega\">\\(i,j\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ne j\">\\(i\\ne j\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathcal D_{\\operatorname{rt}(\\forall_a x_i\\exists_a x_j A)}\">\\(r\\in\\mathcal D_{\\operatorname{rt}(\\forall_a x_i\\exists_a x_j A)}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_r\">\\(f_r\\)</span> 是下式构造的集合函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f_r:=\\{\\langle m,\\pi_0(r(m))\\rangle:m\\in\\omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f_r:=\\{\\langle m,\\pi_0(r(m))\\rangle:m\\in\\omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MR}(r,\\forall_a x_i\\exists_a x_j A,\\eta)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\nf_r:\\omega\\to\\omega\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{MR}(\\pi_1(r(m)),A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m][j\\mapsto f_r(m)]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MR}(r,\\forall_a x_i\\exists_a x_j A,\\eta)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\nf_r:\\omega\\to\\omega\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{MR}(\\pi_1(r(m)),A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m][j\\mapsto f_r(m)]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先用全称子句，再用存在子句；实现者类型保证 r(m) 是数与矩阵实现者的有序对，故 f_r 是全定义数函数。没有附加可计算性结论：当前载体是全函数层级，若要程序见证，还需单独证明实现者来自某个可计算项模型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modified-realizability-full-model","status":"resolved","id":"5341a0bc9ba0e23a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modified-realizability-full-model","status":"resolved","id":"5341a0bc9ba0e23a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]]；$A\\in\\mathcal M_a$，$i,j\\in\\omega$，$i\\ne j$，$\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal M_a","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"i\\ne j","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathcal D_{\\operatorname{rt}(\\forall_a x_i\\exists_a x_j A)}","display":false},{"tex":"f_r","display":false},{"tex":"f_r:=\\{\\langle m,\\pi_0(r(m))\\rangle:m\\in\\omega\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MR}(r,\\forall_a x_i\\exists_a x_j A,\\eta)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\nf_r:\\omega\\to\\omega\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{MR}(\\pi_1(r(m)),A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m][j\\mapsto f_r(m)]).","display":true}],"bytes":1676,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-164","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effe